step Wrongly Blamed, Justly Corrected
  when group 97250
  tip These are elite mobs: grouping up is encouraged, look for people to do it with. Outraged Pillager is a level 23 elite: most classes solo it at level 25, but you may need help. Skip it if you are alone: the route has you grind the XP back.
  kill 268622 quest 97250.1 @26.0,44.2 map 1445 live only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead
  kill 268623 quest 97250.2 @25.8,45.0 map 1445 live only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead

