step Islen Waterseer
  only Shaman
  zone The Barrens
  tip Fly from Orgrimmar to Ratchet. Islen Waterseer camps on the coast a short walk south of the town; fly on to Freewind Post from Ratchet.
  fly "Ratchet"
  turnin 96                           -- Islen Waterseer: Healing Stream Totem and your Water Totem

step Fly to the Crossroads
  when !turnedin 1145
  when !onquest 1145
  zone Orgrimmar
  tip Korran's The Swarm Grows needed level 29 on the last guide's Crossroads stop: take it now, on a short flight to the Crossroads and back.
  zone The Barrens
  zone Orgrimmar
  goto 45.3,63.7 "Orgrimmar flight master" only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead
  goto 45.3,63.7 "Orgrimmar flight master" only Skyborne,!Shaman

