  zone Thousand Needles
  tip South-west back to the raceway.
  turnin 1110 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead -- Kravel Koalbeard
  turnin 1105 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead -- Wizzle Brassbolts
  turnin 1176 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead -- Pozzik

step Shimmering Flats: kill these as you meet them
