step Gadgetzan
  zone Tanaris
  tip South from the raceway over the Tanaris border to Gadgetzan, the walled goblin town: learn its flight path and fly back to Freewind Post from there, which is quicker than the walk west across the flats, and the next guides fly straight to Gadgetzan.
  goto 51.6,26.0 map 1446 "Gadgetzan"

step Freewind Post
  zone Thousand Needles
  tip Cliffwatcher Longhorn stands in the middle of the post, on the way to the flight master.
  accept 5361 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead -- Cliffwatcher Longhorn: for Nataka Longhorn in Desolace, next
  vendor nearest

step Fly to Sun Rock Retreat
  zone Thousand Needles
  zone Stonetalon Mountains
  zone Thousand Needles
  goto 45.0,49.1 "Freewind Post flight master"

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Into Desolace

step Fly to Sun Rock Retreat
  zone Thousand Needles
  goto 45.0,49.1 "Freewind Post flight master"
  fly "Sun Rock Retreat"
  zone Stonetalon Mountains

step To Ghost Walker Post
  zone Desolace
  goto 55.4,55.8 "To Ghost Walker Post"

step Ghost Walker Post
  zone Desolace
  tip Felgur stands in the post, Nataka Longhorn up on its rise.
  turnin 5361 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead -- Nataka Longhorn, up on the rise

step Takata Steelblade
  when onquest 1432
  zone Desolace
  turnin 1432 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead -- Takata Steelblade

step Takata and Maurin
  zone Desolace
  accept 1433 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead -- Takata Steelblade
  accept 1434 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead
  turnin 1433 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead -- Maurin Bonesplitter
  accept 1435

step Aka'rai
  tip Aka'rai may not be here on Forever: if Aka'rai doesn't offer Hate the Hatefury, skip it.
  accept 97265 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead optional

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The west coast

step Shadowprey Village
  zone Desolace
  tip Head west to the troll village on the coast, keeping clear of the Gelkis Village on the way. Aka'rai stands on the path just north of the village.
  tip Aka'rai may not be here on Forever: if Aka'rai doesn't offer Hate the Hatefury, skip it.
  sethome "Shadowprey Village"
  accept 5763 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead -- Roon Wildmane: for Hemet Nesingwary in Stranglethorn, next guide
  accept 6142                         -- Mai'Lahii
  getfp "Shadowprey Village"          -- Thalon, at the village's south-west end

step Rackmore's Log
  zone Desolace
  tip Rackmore's Log lies on the ground just south-west of Azore's tower, on the way down to the shore: read it. Its two keys drop only while you have the quest.
  accept 6161 object 177787 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead -- Rackmore's Log

step Clam beds
  zone Desolace
  tip Head north up the coast. Giant Softshell Clams lie in the shallows and the Enraged Reef Crawlers walk the beach: each clam you open on the sea floor, and some crawlers, give a Soft-shelled Clam. Open each one in your bags for its meat.
  interact 177784 quest 6142.1 @30.6,31.9 map 1443 -- Giant Softshell Clams, on the sea floor
  use 15874 quest 6142.1 @30.6,31.9 map 1443 -- Soft-shelled Clam: open it in your bags
  collect 15878 quest 6161.1 @33.4,30.1 map 1443 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead -- Rackmore's Silver Key, from the Drysnap crabs; underwater
  collect 15924 quest 6142            -- Underwater

step Sar'theris Strand
  zone Desolace
  tip Keep north to Sar'theris Strand for Rackmore's Golden Key: any Slitherblade can drop it.
  tip Careful: the Myrmidons (34-35) hold the beach's northern half with the Sea Witches and Oracles (34-36, casters), up to two over you at 33: work the Naga and Sorceresses (32-33) of the southern half until the key drops, and leave the north for the second Desolace visit, at 38.
  collect 15881 quest 6161.2 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead -- Rackmore's Golden Key, from the Slitherblade naga

step Ethel Rethor
  zone Desolace
  tip Head north along the coast, then inland to the ruined tower of Ethel Rethor: Azore Aldamort waits inside. The coast's clams and naga come after Thunder Axe Fortress, on one walk north to Ranazjar Isle.
  accept 5741 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead -- Azore Aldamort

step Thunder Axe Fortress
  zone Desolace
  tip Head east to Thunder Axe Fortress. Beat a Burning Blade cultist down, then use the Burning Gem on it before it dies to fill one Infused Burning Gem. The Burning Blade Seer stands on the fortress's top floor with the Sceptre. The cultists also drop a Flayed Demon Skin now and then (1-5%); if one drops, read it. Hand of Iruxos: clear the middle of the largest building, then use the Demon Pick on the red Hand of Iruxos Crystal there. A Demon Spirit (37) comes out: kill it for the Demon Box.
  collect 15750 quest 5741 @55.2,30.1 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead -- On the top floor
  collect 6435 quest 1435 @55,26.5 map 1443 era
  collect 20310 x1 optional
  accept 1480 optional only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead

step Ethel Rethor
  zone Desolace
  tip Back west to Azore.
  turnin 5741 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead -- Azore Aldamort
  note Azore's next errand, the Book of the Ancients, needs Lord Kragaru (38) out on Ranazjar Isle: leave it, he is over your level.

step Rackmore's Chest
  zone Desolace
  tip Swim out to Ranazjar Isle off the far northern tip: Rackmore's Chest stands on the shore beside the Serpent Statue. Open it with both keys; leave the statue alone.
  turnin 6161 @30.0,8.7 map 1443 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead -- Rackmore's Chest

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- North-east
step Sargeron: kill these as you meet them
  zone Desolace
  tip Head east past Thunder Axe Fortress and along the northern hills to the satyrs' ruins of Sargeron. Kill every kind you meet for Aka'rai; the Shadowstalkers walk unseen.
  tip Careful: Hatefury Rogues use Hide when they spawn, so they are stealthed until you find them.
  kill 4675 quest 97265.2 @74.2,23.6 map 1443 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead optional
  kill 4674 quest 97265.3 @74.2,23.6 map 1443 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead optional
  kill 4673 quest 1434.3 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead
  kill 4675 quest 1434.4 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead
  kill 4671 quest 97265.1 @76.0,22.5 map 1443 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead optional
  kill 4672 quest 97265.4 @73.7,21.3 map 1443 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead optional
  kill 4670 quest 97265.5 @76.0,22.5 map 1443 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead optional
  kill 4670 quest 1434.1 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead
  kill 4672 quest 1434.2 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead

step Ghost Walker Post
  zone Desolace
  tip Takata Steelblade and Maurin Bonesplitter wait on the rise west of it, above the Kodo Graveyard. South-west down the road to the post.
  turnin 1434 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead -- Takata Steelblade
  accept 1436 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead -- Takata Steelblade: for Keldran in Orgrimmar, next guide
  note Felgur now offers Centaur Bounty: the second Desolace visit, at 38, takes it on its way to the Valley of Spears.
  turnin 1435                         -- Maurin Bonesplitter
  turnin 1480 optional only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Shadowprey

step Shadowprey Village
  zone Desolace
  tip West to Shadowprey: your hearthstone is bound there.
  turnin 6142                         -- Mai'Lahii
  note Taiga's Hand of Iruxos, Drulzegar's Other Fish to Fry and Desolace's other 37-40 quests wait for the second visit, at 38: the next guides fly to Orgrimmar and take the zeppelin to Stranglethorn Vale.
